ozen Depths Lore +22</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative, Poison and Cold spells gain a +22% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Power_of_the_Frozen_Depths\" title=\"Power of the Frozen Depths\">Power of the Frozen Depths</a> +154<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Power_of_the_Frozen_Depths\" title=\"Power of the Frozen Depths\">Power of the Frozen Depths</a> +154:</b> Passive: +154 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Negative, Cold and Poison Spell Power.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Negative Energy Absorption\">Negative Energy Absorption</a> - 50 Charges (Recharged/Day: 10)<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Negative Energy Absorption\">Negative Energy Absorption</a>:</b> This effect absorbs negative energy and energy drain effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Legendary Nightmare Guard\">Legendary Nightmare&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"